*{{skill icon|Pain}}

== Notes ==

{{Anomaly|If this NPC is called as a target and your [[Options#General|Chat option filter]] is set to filter offensive words, the name will appear as ''"----ed Crewman''".}}

== Trivia ==

* The [[Game updates/20080131|January 31, 2008 update]] replaced the Crewman's [[Destructive Was Glaive]] with [[Clamor of Souls]] to reduce the range and size of the [[spike]] damage that they caused during the end-dungeon fight in which they appear. <small>([[Game updates/20080131|Source]].)</small> However, Clamor of Souls itself was changed on [[Game updates/20081211|December 11, 2008]] to an [[AoE]] damage skill, resulting in a return to a significant area-wide damage spike each time the Crewmen spawn.
** The new range is smaller (''Nearby'' instead of ''In the Area'').
** The size of the ''Clamor'' spike is about 35% less than the ''DWG'' one.
